              "content": "The Profile Service employs a sophisticated algorithm to compute a detailed climate profile, drawing upon the responses gathered through a survey obtained from the Surveys Service. This process involves a meticulous analysis of user-provided answers to generate a comprehensive and nuanced representation of their climate preferences and perspectives. See (https://surveyjs.io/survey-creator)",
